### Review inbox — calls waiting for a verdict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reviews/filter
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "status": "PENDING",
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### One call's quality row (transcript and recording: GET /api/reports/calls/{callId})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/call-reviews/55
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### The agent was wrong
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/call-reviews/55
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "status": "AGENT_WRONG",
  "reason": "Yetkazib berish narxini to'qidi"
}

### Add the answer the call lacked to the agent's knowledge base
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reviews/55/knowledge-item
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "key": "delivery_price",
  "topic": "delivery",
  "title": "Yetkazib berish narxi",
  "answerUz": "Toshkent bo'ylab yetkazib berish 30 ming so'm."
}

### Turn the call into a test case
POST http://localhost:8080/api/call-reviews/55/test-case
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Yetkazib berish narxini so'raydi",
  "personaPrompt": "Siz Samarqandga yetkazib berish narxini so'raysiz va aniq raqam talab qilasiz.",
  "mustNotSay": ["bepul yetkazib beramiz"]
}
